WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.753
DANE WHITMAN
Why didn't you guys help fight Thanos?

00:00:03.875 --> 00:00:06.590
Or any war or all the other
terrible things throughout history?

00:00:06.915 --> 00:00:08.277
SERSI
We were instructed not to interfere

00:00:08.327 --> 00:00:10.552
in any human conflicts
unless Deviants were involved.

00:00:11.454 --> 00:00:12.471
DANE WHITMAN
By who?

00:00:18.079 --> 00:00:21.706
KEVIN FEIGE
The Eternals explores the very creation

00:00:21.757 --> 00:00:23.706
of the Marvel universe itself.

00:00:24.253 --> 00:00:25.616
NATE MOORE
The film also deals very much with

00:00:25.666 --> 00:00:29.029
the aftermath of Avengers 4
and the state the world is in.

00:00:29.449 --> 00:00:30.320
GEMMA CHAN
Five of the Eternals are

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:32.115
more of the thinkers,

00:00:33.187 --> 00:00:35.619
and the other five
are the stronger fighters.

00:00:39.068 --> 00:00:40.962
KEVIN FEIGE
Eternals are these remarkably

00:00:41.013 --> 00:00:42.613
superpowered characters,

00:00:45.958 --> 00:00:48.674
but also a
dysfunctional family unit.

00:00:49.402 --> 00:00:50.560
SPRITE
So this is what the end of the world

00:00:50.611 --> 00:00:53.176
looks like.
At least we have front row seats.

00:00:53.226 --> 00:00:54.693
PHASTOS
You know what's never saved the planet?

00:00:54.743 --> 00:00:55.847
Your sarcasm.

00:00:55.918 --> 00:00:57.391
KEVIN FEIGE
The person to bring that together

00:00:57.441 --> 00:01:00.310
was Academy Award
winner Chloé Zhao.

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:02.504
CHLOÉ ZHAO
We go on these emotional journeys

00:01:02.554 --> 00:01:06.704
with these Eternals to
figure out who they are

00:01:06.755 --> 00:01:08.755
and what it means to be human.

00:01:09.101 --> 00:01:11.530
KUMAIL NANJIANI
Her vision is so clear.

00:01:12.292 --> 00:01:14.123
SALMA HAYEK
It's not the typical place,

00:01:14.173 --> 00:01:18.064
it's not the typical shots,
it's not the typical cast.

00:01:18.115 --> 00:01:19.281
KUMAIL NANJIANI
Everybody looks different,

00:01:19.331 --> 00:01:20.742
everybody sounds different.

00:01:22.268 --> 00:01:23.694
ANGELINA JOLIE
A lot of people are gonna see

00:01:23.744 --> 00:01:26.628
themselves as superheroes
for the first time.

00:01:27.029 --> 00:01:29.011
GEMMA CHAN
It really is an epic, global film.

00:01:29.061 --> 00:01:31.008
The scope and
the scale of it is huge.

00:01:31.989 --> 00:01:33.685
SALMA HAYEK
It's so exciting to be a part

00:01:33.735 --> 00:01:35.981
of something
that really feels new.

00:01:37.474 --> 00:01:38.853
KEVIN FEIGE
The impact that Eternals will have

00:01:38.903 --> 00:01:42.210
on the MCU will be
nothing less than redefining

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:43.854
the cinematic universe entirely.

